<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="With a Picture Without Anyone"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="于无人之画"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="誰もいない絵で"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Isekaijoucho"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヰ世界情緒"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="异世界情緒"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Creation"/><amll:meta key="album" value="創生"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPY392100247"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1907752044"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002jMB9P1ZAK0w"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="336304159"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="7z46ojEqy1m1qprjVksRwG"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1688353224"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:23.330"><div begin="1.060" end="3:23.330"><p begin="1.060" end="6.300" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.060" end="1.420">夜</span><span begin="1.420" end="2.450">明</span><span begin="2.450" end="2.680">け</span><span begin="2.680" end="3.670">を</span><span begin="3.820" end="3.920">待</span><span begin="4.080" end="4.830">つ</span><span begin="5.180" end="5.350">ひ</span><span begin="5.520" end="6.040">と</span><span begin="6.040" end="6.300">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自等待黎明的人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">獨自等待黎明的人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Alone I wait for dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">새벽을 기다리는 홀로 선 나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Seule à attendre l&apos;aube</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sola esperando el amanecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Allein warte ich auf die Morgendämmerung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sozinha espero a aurora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одна я жду рассвета</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Aspetto da sola il sorgere del giorno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yoake o matsu hitori</span></p><p begin="6.540" end="11.990" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.540" end="7.800">最</span><span begin="7.920" end="8.080">後</span><span begin="8.190" end="8.680">の</span><span begin="8.950" end="9.300">詩</span><span begin="9.300" end="9.460">が</span><span begin="9.460" end="9.670">消</span><span begin="9.670" end="9.990">え</span><span begin="9.990" end="10.200">て</span><span begin="10.200" end="11.990">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使最后的诗也消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使最後的詩也消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if the final poem fades away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 시가 사라져도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si le dernier poème s&apos;efface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque desaparezca el último poema</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn das letzte Gedicht vergeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que o último poema se apague</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если последняя песнь исчезнет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se la poesia finale svanisce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Saigo no uta ga kiete mo</span></p><p begin="24.670" end="34.670" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.670" end="25.070">世</span><span begin="25.070" end="25.770">界</span><span begin="25.770" end="26.340">を</span><span begin="26.470" end="27.170">眺</span><span begin="27.170" end="27.340">め</span><span begin="27.340" end="27.570">て</span><span begin="27.670" end="28.020">い</span><span begin="28.020" end="28.440">る</span><span begin="28.790" end="31.600">今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻正眺望着世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻正眺望著世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now I am gazing at the world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 세상을 바라보고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À cet instant je contemple le monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora contemplo el mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt blicke ich auf die Welt hinaus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora contemplo o mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сейчас я смотрю на мир</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ora contemplo il mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sekai o nagamete iru ima</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="30.210" end="34.670"><span begin="30.210" end="31.480">(窓</span><span begin="31.600" end="31.850">辺</span><span begin="31.960" end="32.800">に</span><span begin="32.930" end="33.180">立</span><span begin="33.280" end="34.670">ち)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">站在窗边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">站在窗邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Standing by the window</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">창가에 서서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Debout près de la fenêtre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De pie junto a la ventana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Fenster stehend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De pé junto à janela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Стоя у окна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In piedi accanto alla finestra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Madobe ni tachi</span></span></p><p begin="35.650" end="44.960" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.650" end="36.120">始</span><span begin="36.240" end="36.740">ま</span><span begin="36.740" end="37.170">る</span><span begin="37.410" end="37.610">鼓</span><span begin="37.770" end="38.300">動</span><span begin="38.300" end="38.500">が</span><span begin="38.630" end="39.440">鐘</span><span begin="39.800" end="40.010">の</span><span begin="40.140" end="40.730">よう</span><span begin="40.860" end="43.090">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初生的心跳如钟声一般</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">初生的心跳如鐘聲一般</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The heartbeat beginning like a bell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시작되는 고동이 종소리처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le battement qui commence comme une cloche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El latido que comienza como una campana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der beginnende Herzschlag wie eine Glocke</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O pulsar que começa como um sino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пробуждающийся пульс словно колокол</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il battito che nasce come una campana</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hajimaru kodou ga kane no you ni</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="41.160" end="44.960"><span begin="41.160" end="42.050">(胸</span><span begin="42.220" end="42.790">を</span><span begin="42.860" end="43.130">打</span><span begin="43.250" end="44.540">つ</span><span begin="44.630" end="44.960">の)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">敲击着我的胸口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">敲擊著我的胸口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Strikes against my chest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가슴을 울려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Frappe ma poitrine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Golpea mi pecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schlägt tief in meiner Brust</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Bate contra o meu peito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бьёт мне в грудь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi colpisce il petto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mune o utsu no</span></span></p><p begin="45.270" end="50.430" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.270" end="45.780">光</span><span begin="45.780" end="45.870">を</span><span begin="45.970" end="46.800">探</span><span begin="46.800" end="46.930">し</span><span begin="47.030" end="47.430">て</span><span begin="47.700" end="48.080">手</span><span begin="48.080" end="48.380">の</span><span begin="48.380" end="49.240">赴</span><span begin="49.240" end="49.600">く</span><span begin="49.600" end="49.670">ま</span><span begin="49.790" end="50.430">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻找光芒 随手所向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尋找光芒 隨手所向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Searching for light as my hand is led onward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빛을 찾아 손이 이끄는 대로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cherchant la lumière au gré de ma main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Buscando la luz dejo que mi mano avance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf der Suche nach Licht folge ich meiner Hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Buscando a luz deixo a mão seguir seu rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В поисках света куда ведёт рука</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cercando la luce seguo la mano dove vuole andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hikari o sagashite te no omomuku mama</span></p><p begin="51.090" end="53.820" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.090" end="51.480">描</span><span begin="51.480" end="51.870">い</span><span begin="51.970" end="52.400">て</span><span begin="52.670" end="53.180">届</span><span begin="53.180" end="53.360">い</span><span begin="53.360" end="53.820">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘吧 抵达吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">描繪吧 抵達吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I draw it may it reach you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그려서 닿아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je dessine pour que cela t&apos;atteigne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dibuja alcanza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich zeichne und möge es dich erreichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desenho que te alcance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я рисую и дотягиваюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Disegna e raggiungi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Egaite todoite</span></p><p begin="54.050" end="57.020" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.050" end="54.230">ま</span><span begin="54.230" end="54.510">だ</span><span begin="54.510" end="54.700">見</span><span begin="54.700" end="54.860">ぬ</span><span begin="54.860" end="55.600">明日</span><span begin="55.600" end="57.020">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着仍未见过的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">向著仍未見過的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Toward a tomorrow still unseen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아직 보지 못한 내일로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vers un demain encore inconnu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hacia un mañana aún no visto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hin zu einem Morgen den ich noch nie gesehen habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Rumo ao amanhã ainda desconhecido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К завтрашнему дню которого ещё не видела</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un domani ancora mai visto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mada minu ashita e</span></p><p begin="57.920" end="1:03.220" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.920" end="58.320">す</span><span begin="58.320" end="59.330">ぐ</span><span begin="59.330" end="59.550">そ</span><span begin="59.550" end="1:00.760">ば</span><span begin="1:00.760" end="1:00.960">に</span><span begin="1:00.960" end="1:01.790">あ</span><span begin="1:01.790" end="1:01.860">る</span><span begin="1:02.100" end="1:02.290">も</span><span begin="1:02.290" end="1:02.960">の</span><span begin="1:02.960" end="1:03.220">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近在身边之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">近在身邊之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The things that are right beside me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">바로 곁에 있는 것을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce qui se trouve tout près de moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero saber cómo abrazar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Was doch so nahe bei mir ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero saber como abraçar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То что совсем рядом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di ciò che è proprio accanto a me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sugu soba ni aru mono no</span></p><p begin="1:03.480" end="1:08.700" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.480" end="1:03.710">抱</span><span begin="1:03.810" end="1:04.790">き</span><span begin="1:04.790" end="1:04.940">し</span><span begin="1:05.040" end="1:06.180">め</span><span begin="1:06.180" end="1:07.470">方</span><span begin="1:07.730" end="1:07.930">知</span><span begin="1:07.930" end="1:08.100">り</span><span begin="1:08.100" end="1:08.280">た</span><span begin="1:08.280" end="1:08.460">く</span><span begin="1:08.460" end="1:08.700">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道该如何拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我想知道該如何擁抱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to learn how to hold them close</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어떻게 끌어안는지 알고 싶어서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je voulais savoir comment l&apos;étreindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aquello que está tan cerca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich will wissen wie man es umarmt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquilo que está bem ao meu lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу узнать как обнять</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vorrei sapere come stringerlo tra le braccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakishimekata shiritakute</span></p><p begin="1:08.980" end="1:14.470" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.980" end="1:10.360">溢</span><span begin="1:10.360" end="1:10.520">れ</span><span begin="1:10.520" end="1:11.510">出</span><span begin="1:11.510" end="1:11.660">す</span><span begin="1:11.660" end="1:11.870">こ</span><span begin="1:11.870" end="1:12.740">の</span><span begin="1:13.100" end="1:13.940">感</span><span begin="1:13.940" end="1:14.470">情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份满溢而出的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這份滿溢而出的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This feeling overflowing from within</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흘러넘치는 이 감정</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce sentiment qui déborde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta emoción que se desborda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieses Gefühl das aus mir überquillt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta emoção transbordante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это чувство что переполняет меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa emozione che trabocca</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Afuredasu kono kanjou</span></p><p begin="1:14.790" end="1:22.830" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.790" end="1:15.150">た</span><span begin="1:15.150" end="1:15.320">だ</span><span begin="1:15.320" end="1:16.200">心</span><span begin="1:16.200" end="1:16.580">に</span><span begin="1:16.830" end="1:17.090">ふ</span><span begin="1:17.090" end="1:17.250">れ</span><span begin="1:17.350" end="1:17.580">た</span><span begin="1:17.580" end="1:18.610">い</span><span begin="1:19.610" end="1:20.600">誰</span><span begin="1:20.600" end="1:22.830">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想触碰谁的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只想觸碰誰的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Someone I only wish to touch with my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 마음에 닿고 싶은 누군가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quelqu&apos;un dont je veux seulement toucher le cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Alguien que solo quiere tocar un corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine die nur mein Herz berühren will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Alguém que eu apenas quero tocar no coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кто то чьего сердца я просто хочу коснуться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Qualcuno che voglia solo toccare il cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada kokoro ni furetai dareka</span></p><p begin="1:32.550" end="1:42.370" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.550" end="1:33.020">静</span><span begin="1:33.130" end="1:33.670">か</span><span begin="1:33.670" end="1:34.080">に</span><span begin="1:34.320" end="1:35.010">沈</span><span begin="1:35.010" end="1:35.210">ん</span><span begin="1:35.210" end="1:35.540">で</span><span begin="1:35.540" end="1:35.690">ゆ</span><span begin="1:35.880" end="1:36.370">く</span><span begin="1:36.730" end="1:38.400">夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">静静沉入深处的梦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">靜靜沉入深處的夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A dream sinking quietly down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">조용히 가라앉아 가는 꿈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un rêve qui sombre en silence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un sueño que se hunde en silencio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Traum sinkt still hinab</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um sonho afundando em silêncio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сон тихо погружается в глубину</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un sogno che sprofonda piano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shizuka ni shizunde yuku yume</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:38.100" end="1:42.370"><span begin="1:38.100" end="1:39.340">(眠</span><span begin="1:39.450" end="1:39.690">り</span><span begin="1:39.830" end="1:40.700">の</span><span begin="1:40.830" end="1:41.010">な</span><span begin="1:41.180" end="1:42.370">か)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在沉眠之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在沉眠之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Within my sleep</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잠 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au fond du sommeil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dentro del sueño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mitten im Schlaf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dentro do sono</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Внутри сна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dentro il sonno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nemuri no naka</span></span></p><p begin="1:43.590" end="1:53.330" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.590" end="1:44.020">遠</span><span begin="1:44.130" end="1:44.610">く</span><span begin="1:44.610" end="1:44.960">へ</span><span begin="1:45.310" end="1:46.010">離</span><span begin="1:46.010" end="1:46.170">れ</span><span begin="1:46.170" end="1:46.450">て</span><span begin="1:46.550" end="1:46.710">ゆ</span><span begin="1:46.860" end="1:47.330">く</span><span begin="1:47.690" end="1:48.730">声</span><span begin="1:48.730" end="1:50.780">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐远去的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸遠去的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A voice drifting far away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">먼 곳으로 멀어져 가는 목소리를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une voix qui s&apos;éloigne au loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La voz que se alejaba hacia lo lejos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Stimme die sich in die Ferne verlor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A voz que se afastava para longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Голос что удалялся вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La voce che si allontana verso luoghi remoti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tooku e hanarete yuku koe o</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:49.080" end="1:53.330"><span begin="1:49.080" end="1:49.390">(つ</span><span begin="1:49.520" end="1:49.830">な</span><span begin="1:50.100" end="1:50.800">ぎ</span><span begin="1:50.800" end="1:51.080">と</span><span begin="1:51.170" end="1:52.350">め</span><span begin="1:52.470" end="1:53.330">た)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾将它系留</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我曾將它繫留</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I held it fast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">붙잡아 두었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je l&apos;ai retenue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La mantuve unida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hielt ich fest damit sie nicht zerreißt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu prendi para que não se fosse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я удержала чтобы он не оборвался</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io l ho trattenuta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsunagitometa</span></span></p><p begin="1:53.180" end="1:58.200" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.180" end="1:53.540">何</span><span begin="1:53.540" end="1:53.720">も</span><span begin="1:53.720" end="1:53.910">埋</span><span begin="1:53.910" end="1:54.390">め</span><span begin="1:54.390" end="1:54.720">ら</span><span begin="1:54.720" end="1:54.890">れ</span><span begin="1:54.890" end="1:55.100">な</span><span begin="1:55.100" end="1:55.220">い</span><span begin="1:55.560" end="1:56.240">空</span><span begin="1:56.240" end="1:56.980">白</span><span begin="1:56.980" end="1:57.170">の</span><span begin="1:57.170" end="1:57.670">中</span><span begin="1:57.670" end="1:58.200">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在什么也无法填满的空白之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在什麼也無法填滿的空白之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Inside a blank that nothing could ever fill</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇으로도 메울 수 없는 공백 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce blanc que rien ne peut combler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En un vacío que nada puede llenar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einer Leere die nichts ausfüllen kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dentro de um vazio que nada pode preencher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В пустоте которую ничем не заполнить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un vuoto che nulla può colmare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani mo umerarenai kuuhaku no naka de</span></p><p begin="1:58.990" end="2:04.660" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.990" end="1:59.360">確</span><span begin="1:59.360" end="1:59.740">か</span><span begin="1:59.890" end="2:00.280">な</span><span begin="2:00.550" end="2:01.050">温</span><span begin="2:01.050" end="2:01.230">度</span><span begin="2:01.230" end="2:01.650">を</span><span begin="2:01.900" end="2:02.070">つ</span><span begin="2:02.070" end="2:02.340">よ</span><span begin="2:02.340" end="2:02.560">く</span><span begin="2:02.560" end="2:03.030">求</span><span begin="2:03.030" end="2:03.260">め</span><span begin="2:03.260" end="2:03.480">て</span><span begin="2:03.480" end="2:04.660">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾强烈追寻真实的温度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我曾強烈追尋真實的溫度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I was longing so fiercely for a certain warmth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">분명한 온기를 간절히 바랐어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je cherchais ardemment une chaleur certaine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Buscaba con fuerza una temperatura cierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Suchte ich verzweifelt nach einer wahrhaftigen Wärme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu buscava intensamente uma temperatura real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я отчаянно искала подлинное тепло</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cercavo con forza un calore certo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tashika na ondo o tsuyoku motometeta</span></p><p begin="2:05.860" end="2:11.100" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.860" end="2:06.180">ど</span><span begin="2:06.180" end="2:07.260">こ</span><span begin="2:07.260" end="2:07.420">ま</span><span begin="2:07.420" end="2:08.490">で</span><span begin="2:08.590" end="2:09.670">風</span><span begin="2:09.960" end="2:10.340">を</span><span begin="2:10.340" end="2:10.680">追</span><span begin="2:10.680" end="2:10.840">っ</span><span begin="2:10.840" end="2:11.100">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论要追逐风到何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論要追逐風到何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No matter how far I chase the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디까지 바람을 따라가도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jusqu&apos;où puis je poursuivre le vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por más lejos que persiga el viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie weit ich auch dem Wind nachjage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até onde perseguirei o vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как далеко я буду гнаться за ветром</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fin dove inseguirò il vento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko made kaze o otte</span></p><p begin="2:11.330" end="2:16.550" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.330" end="2:12.720">傷</span><span begin="2:12.720" end="2:12.910">つ</span><span begin="2:12.910" end="2:14.090">い</span><span begin="2:14.090" end="2:14.280">て</span><span begin="2:14.280" end="2:15.500">も</span><span begin="2:15.640" end="2:15.800">止</span><span begin="2:15.800" end="2:15.990">ま</span><span begin="2:15.990" end="2:16.160">れ</span><span begin="2:16.160" end="2:16.320">な</span><span begin="2:16.320" end="2:16.550">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使遍体鳞伤也无法停下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使遍體鱗傷也無法停下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I am wounded I cannot stop</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">상처 입어도 멈출 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même blessée je ne peux m&apos;arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque me hiera no puedo detenerme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst verletzt kann ich nicht stehen bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo ferida não consigo parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже ранясь не смогу остановиться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per quanto ferita non posso fermarmi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizutsuite mo tomarenai</span></p><p begin="2:16.820" end="2:22.320" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.820" end="2:18.230">僕</span><span begin="2:18.230" end="2:18.400">の</span><span begin="2:18.400" end="2:19.600">ま</span><span begin="2:19.600" end="2:19.760">ま</span><span begin="2:19.760" end="2:20.560">で</span><span begin="2:20.940" end="2:21.120">い</span><span begin="2:21.240" end="2:21.640">つ</span><span begin="2:21.780" end="2:22.320">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天我想以真实的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">總有一天我想以真實的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Someday as myself</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나 그대로 언젠가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En restant moi même un jour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siendo yo misma algún día</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eines Tages will ich so wie ich bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sendo eu mesma um dia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Однажды оставаясь собой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Restando me stessa un giorno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku no mama de itsuka</span></p><p begin="2:22.660" end="2:30.850" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.660" end="2:23.010">た</span><span begin="2:23.010" end="2:23.180">だ</span><span begin="2:23.180" end="2:23.440">ひ</span><span begin="2:23.560" end="2:23.850">と</span><span begin="2:23.850" end="2:24.040">つ</span><span begin="2:24.040" end="2:24.500">と</span><span begin="2:24.730" end="2:25.010">出</span><span begin="2:25.010" end="2:25.230">会</span><span begin="2:25.230" end="2:25.430">い</span><span begin="2:25.430" end="2:26.970">た</span><span begin="2:26.970" end="2:27.050">い</span><span begin="2:27.490" end="2:27.730">こ</span><span begin="2:27.830" end="2:28.380">こ</span><span begin="2:28.500" end="2:30.850">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这里遇见那唯一之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這裡遇見那唯一之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to meet the one and only thing here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이곳에서 단 하나와 만나고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je veux rencontrer l&apos;unique chose ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero encontrar aquí lo único verdadero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hier der Einzigen begegnen die alles bedeutet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero encontrar aqui algo único</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хочу встретить здесь единственное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio incontrare quell unica cosa qui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada hitotsu to deaitai koko ni</span></p><p begin="2:39.130" end="2:44.230" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.130" end="2:40.530">誰</span><span begin="2:40.530" end="2:40.970">に</span><span begin="2:41.190" end="2:41.570">知</span><span begin="2:41.570" end="2:41.880">ら</span><span begin="2:41.880" end="2:42.550">れ</span><span begin="2:42.550" end="2:43.290">ず</span><span begin="2:43.290" end="2:43.960">と</span><span begin="2:43.960" end="2:44.230">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使不为任何人所知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使不為任何人所知</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if no one ever knows</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누구에게도 알려지지 않아도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si personne ne le sait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque nadie llegue a saberlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn niemand davon erfährt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo sem que ninguém saiba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть никто об этом не узнает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se nessuno lo saprà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare ni shirarezu tomo</span></p><p begin="2:44.620" end="2:51.570" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.620" end="2:45.360">消</span><span begin="2:45.360" end="2:46.010">え</span><span begin="2:46.010" end="2:46.690">な</span><span begin="2:46.690" end="2:46.950">い</span><span begin="2:47.220" end="2:48.090">詩</span><span begin="2:48.090" end="2:48.370">を</span><span begin="2:48.590" end="2:49.410">記</span><span begin="2:49.410" end="2:51.570">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要写下不会消失的诗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也要寫下不會消失的詩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I will write a poem that will not disappear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사라지지 않을 시를 새겨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;inscris un poème qui ne disparaîtra pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Escribo un poema que no se borrará</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schreibe ich ein Gedicht das nie vergeht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Registro um poema que não desaparecerá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я запишу песнь что не исчезнет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Scriverò una poesia che non svanirà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kienai uta o shirusu</span></p><p begin="2:52.480" end="2:57.730" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.480" end="2:52.850">終</span><span begin="2:52.850" end="2:53.880">わ</span><span begin="2:53.880" end="2:53.980">り</span><span begin="2:54.080" end="2:55.030">の</span><span begin="2:55.240" end="2:55.390">な</span><span begin="2:55.390" end="2:56.210">い</span><span begin="2:56.590" end="2:57.470">創</span><span begin="2:57.470" end="2:57.730">造</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽的创造</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無盡的創造</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An endless creation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없는 창조</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une création sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una creación sin final</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Schöpfung ohne Ende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma criação sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бесконечное творение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una creazione senza fine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Owari no nai souzou</span></p><p begin="2:58.010" end="3:03.210" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.010" end="2:59.570">心</span><span begin="2:59.570" end="3:00.610">は</span><span begin="3:00.740" end="3:01.980">もう</span><span begin="3:02.250" end="3:02.470">知</span><span begin="3:02.470" end="3:02.620">っ</span><span begin="3:02.620" end="3:02.780">て</span><span begin="3:02.780" end="3:02.950">い</span><span begin="3:02.950" end="3:03.210">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心早已知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">心早已知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My heart already knew</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음은 이미 알고 있었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon cœur le savait déjà</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi corazón ya lo sabía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Herz hatte es längst gewusst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu coração já sabia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сердце уже знало</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il cuore ormai lo sapeva</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro wa mou shitte ita</span></p><p begin="3:03.490" end="3:10.400" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.490" end="3:03.790">こ</span><span begin="3:03.790" end="3:04.860">こ</span><span begin="3:04.860" end="3:05.010">に</span><span begin="3:05.010" end="3:06.200">い</span><span begin="3:06.200" end="3:06.350">る</span><span begin="3:06.350" end="3:07.280">と</span><span begin="3:07.560" end="3:08.480">叫</span><span begin="3:08.480" end="3:08.930">び</span><span begin="3:09.280" end="3:09.830">続</span><span begin="3:09.830" end="3:10.070">け</span><span begin="3:10.170" end="3:10.400">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断呐喊着我就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不斷吶喊著我就在這裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It keeps crying out that I am here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여기에 있다고 계속 외치며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je continue de crier que je suis ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo gritando que estoy aquí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es schreit weiter dass ich hier bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo gritando que estou aqui</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я продолжаю кричать что я здесь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuando a gridare che sono qui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Koko ni iru to sakebitsuzukete</span></p><p begin="3:10.480" end="3:14.640" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.480" end="3:11.080">青</span><span begin="3:11.080" end="3:11.150">く</span><span begin="3:11.390" end="3:11.610">燃</span><span begin="3:11.610" end="3:11.860">え</span><span begin="3:11.860" end="3:12.030">る</span><span begin="3:12.030" end="3:13.470">火</span><span begin="3:13.780" end="3:14.000">の</span><span begin="3:14.100" end="3:14.480">よう</span><span begin="3:14.480" end="3:14.640">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同青蓝燃烧的火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同青藍燃燒的火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a flame burning blue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">푸르게 타오르는 불꽃처럼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme une flamme bleue qui brûle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como una llama que arde azul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie eine Flamme die blau brennt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como uma chama que arde em azul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно пламя горящее синим</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un fuoco che arde azzurro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aoku moeru hi no you ni</span></p><p begin="3:14.780" end="3:18.890" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.780" end="3:15.320">誰</span><span begin="3:15.320" end="3:15.630">も</span><span begin="3:15.630" end="3:15.980">い</span><span begin="3:15.980" end="3:16.200">な</span><span begin="3:16.200" end="3:16.580">い</span><span begin="3:16.830" end="3:17.100">絵</span><span begin="3:17.100" end="3:17.330">の</span><span begin="3:17.330" end="3:18.890">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于无人之画中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於無人之畫中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Inside a picture without anyone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아무도 없는 그림 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans une image sans personne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dentro de una pintura sin nadie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einem Bild ohne irgendwen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dentro de uma pintura sem ninguém</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В картине где никого нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dentro un quadro senza nessuno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare mo inai e no naka</span></p><p begin="3:19.530" end="3:23.330" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.530" end="3:19.940">夜</span><span begin="3:19.940" end="3:20.070">が</span><span begin="3:20.070" end="3:20.560">明</span><span begin="3:20.560" end="3:20.770">け</span><span begin="3:20.770" end="3:23.330">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜色迎来黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">夜色迎來黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The night breaks into dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">밤이 밝아 와</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La nuit se lève</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Amanece la noche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bricht die Nacht zum Morgen auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A noite amanhece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наступает рассвет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Si fa giorno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yo ga akeru</span></p></div></body></tt>